regress/artifacts/sgirandomcolour/pass2_20260910/ollama_kimi.txt:17:Delete the `x=%i y=%i` conversions and the `x, y` arguments from the announce — the contract itself discloses x/y as unrowed. Every row keys on substrings (ANN, DECL), the old-literal prefix, or the destination word. Row that stays green that looks like it shouldn't: **`announce text`** (it counts only the DECL substring). (Same-shape alternative: renumber `BADCOLOR` to `1<<13` and fix the comments — bit identity is unobservable except versus shared-with-BADMODE, so all rows pass while the enum's documented next-free invariant silently shifts. The x/y deletion is a smaller true regression.)
