regress/artifacts/sgirandomcolour/pass2_20260910/grok.txt:1:I'll verify the uncommitted `#519` diff against `GXEMUL-SEC/src/` rather than the packet, then answer Q1–Q6 from what the files actually do.Git is blocked from this seat, so I'll read `GXEMUL-SEC` files and greps next to check each premise against the tree.The enum and latch look as claimed; next I’ll read the full PUT/GET helper, the probe, and the `color mode` greps that could go silent.The helper and probe match the packet so far; I’ll now check endianness, BYTEMASK, the GET arm vs pre-fix, and whether any live probe still keys on the old per-pixel text.**VERDICT: NOT RATIFY the detector as complete; the product fix is sound.** Premises (a)–(e) hold on the tree. Q2 names two one-token edits that keep all 14 rows green. Fix those (or disclose them) before table 1; do not ship the 14-row contract as written.
