69: 
70:-	    THE NEXT FREE BIT IS 1 << 12, AND THIS IS THE LAST ENUMERATOR --
71:-	    which is where that claim belongs, per the convention two comments
72:-	    up.  A maintainer adding a bit BELOW this line must move this
73:-	    sentence with it and demote the copy here, exactly as #513 had to
74:-	    demote SGIRE_W_BADMODE's.
75:+	    (This comment used to end "THE NEXT FREE BIT IS 1 << 12, AND THIS
76:+	    IS THE LAST ENUMERATOR".  #519 added SGIRE_W_BADCOLOR = 1 << 12
77:+	    BELOW this line and moved the sentence with it, as this comment
